{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Sally's On-The-Job Training"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Helping Out a Co-Worker"}, {"type": "position", "content": 9}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 17}, {"type": "level", "content": "A2.2"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Accurately use information about people's jobs and places of work in communicative situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn5le17ob09re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Making and Responding to Requests"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "It's important to be polite when you ask for something or respond to requests."}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Would you mind showing me how to use the photocopier?<br><span class=\"strong\">Ken</span>: Sure, no problem."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Making a Request \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Responding to a Request\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Can you ... ?<br><br> Could you ... ?<br><br> Will you ... ?<br><br> Would you mind ... ?<br>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Sure, no problem.<br><br> It would be my pleasure.<br><br>  Of course, I'd be happy to.<br>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Giving and Understanding Instructions"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "When you give instructions on how to do something, you use these words that show the order of actions:<br><br>  First<br> Then<br> Next<br> After that<br> Finally  <br><br> To show you understand instructions, you can use these expressions:<br><br>  Alright<br> OK, I understand<br> Perfect<br> Got it<br> Cool"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Ken</span>: First, let's make sure the photocopier is turned on. You turn it on with this button here.<br> <span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:  I see."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "original "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the document you want to make copies of"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You put the originals on the screen or above the cover. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le17ob09aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use when you talk about a photocopier."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "photocopier "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "machine used to make copies of a document "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'm having a hard time using this photocopier. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le17ob09aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "machine"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a mechanical device used to perform a task"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": " Example: You have to open the machine like this."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le17ob09aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "button"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " a place you press with your figure to select an option on a machine"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": " Example: You turn it on with this button here. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le17ob09aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "screen "}, {"type": "definition", "content": " a flat, square space on a machine like a computer or photocopier that reads or shows a document"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": " Example: Put the originals on the photocopier right here."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le17ob09aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "control panel "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a part of a machine that has many options "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You need to select the paper size on the control panel. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le17ob09aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "cover"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "part of a photocopier that opens and closes over the screen "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:  You can place the documents above the cover."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le17ob09aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to get jammed "}, {"type": "definition", "content": " to become stuck so something can't move"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": " Example: Could you tell what to do if the paper gets jammed?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le17ob09aud08"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "knob"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "part of a machine you turn with your hand to select an option or cause an action  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: If you see a piece of paper, turn the knobs here to remove it. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le17ob09aud09"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Choose a machine you use at work."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write a dialogue giving instructions on how to use the machine. Remember to use words to show the order of actions (<span class=\"italic\">First, ...</span> , <span class=\"italic\">Then, ...</span>)."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Another person uses expressions to show they understand the instructions (<span class=\"italic\">I see. Got it.</span>)"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Practice your dialogue with a partner."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Change roles."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I think of the instructions on how to use a machine."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write a dialogue of 8 - 10 lines."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I practice the dialogue."}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn5le17ob09re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn5le17ob09re2img06.jpg", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn5le17ob09re2img06.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Ken</span>:  Hi Sally! How's it going?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Hi Ken. Things are going well.  <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Ken</span>: Is there anything you need help with?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I'm having a hard time using the photocopier. Would you mind showing me how to use it?", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn5le17ob09re2img06.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Ken</span>:  Sure, no problem. First, let's make sure the photocopier is turned on. You turn it on with this button here. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:  I see.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Ken</span>: Then, you place the originals on the screen or above the cover. Next, you need to select the paper size and indicate how many copies you want on the control panel. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:  Got it.", "id": 2, "time": "10000", "image": "engenn5le17ob09re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Ken</span>: After that, you push the start button here. Finally, you pick up the copies in this paper tray.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I understand. Could you tell me what to do if the paper gets jammed?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Ken</span>: Of course. You have to open the machine like this. If you see a piece of paper, turn the knobs here to remove it. Don't pull, or it will tear 